OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,8,Fwill be sentenced this week after
OL,9,Fpleading guilty to 67 offences
OL,10,Fspanning 12 years and affecting
OL,11,Fhundreds of victims.
OL,13,FBush, 48, who ran Legacy Independent
OL,14,FFuneral Directors, gave grieving
OL,15,Ffamilies the wrong ashes while their
OL,16,Floved ones' bodies were left at his
OL,17,Fsite for months.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
