FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FPolice were contacted by someone with
OL,8,Faccess to the site in March 2024,
OL,9,Fexpressing concerns over "care of the
OL,10,Fdeceased" at the Hull business.
OL,12,FWhen officers searched the premises
OL,13,Fthey found 31 bodies that should have
OL,14,Fbeen cremated months earlier,
OL,15,Fincluding a stillborn baby that had
OL,16,Fbeen there for almost two years.
OL,18,FThey also found more than 100 sets of
OL,19,Fashes, some with name labels and
OL,20,Fletters attached to the box.
OL,26,@qD@ZOUrD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
