FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FPolice found that many families of the
OL,8,Fdeceased found at Legacy had already
OL,9,Fbeen given ashes by Bush, revealing a
OL,10,Fwidespread practice of him giving
OL,11,Fgrieving relatives the wrong ashes.
OL,13,FInvestigators also learned that Bush
OL,14,Fhad committed fraudulent trading in
OL,15,Frelation to funeral plans, where he
OL,16,Fwould take payment for the plans but
OL,17,Fnot pass any of the money on to the
OL,18,Ffinancial institutions who would hold
OL,19,Fit for when the funeral was required.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
