CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FHe also stole from charities by
OL,8,Ffailing to pass on donations collected
OL,9,Fat funerals.
OL,11,FIn April Bush pleaded guilty to 30
OL,12,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,13,Fdecent burial, and theft from 12
OL,14,Fcharities including the Salvation Army
OL,15,Fand Macmillan Cancer Support.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
