PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FHe had already admitted 30 counts of
OL,8,Ffraud by false representation relating
OL,9,Fto bodies found at the site, and four
OL,10,F"foetus allegations" of fraud, where
OL,11,Fhe presented ashes to women falsely
OL,12,Fsaying that they were "the remains of
OL,13,Ftheir unborn".
OL,15,FBush also pleaded guilty to a further
OL,16,Fcharge of fraud, covering the ashes of
OL,17,F57 people between 2017 and 2024, and
OL,18,Fone of fraudulent trading relating to
OL,19,Ffuneral plans between 2012 and 2024.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@TO]tD@WOUuD@MO]
