PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785125901
OL,3,CCrooked funeral director Robert Bush
OL,4,Cto be sentenced for more than 65
OL,5,Coffences
OL,7,FThe sentencing at Hull Crown Court is
OL,8,Flisted for five days, and is expected
OL,9,Fto hear from more than 100 victims.
OL,11,FBush, formerly of Kirk Ella, East
OL,12,FYorkshire, but now of Otley, West
OL,13,FYorkshire, is on conditional bail.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
